296
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:12,520
F*ck you.

297
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:13,720
F*ck you!

298
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:14,760
F*ck you!

299
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,200
F*ck you!

300
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:23,760
