- You've done this way too many times.

345
00:17:59,120 --> 00:17:59,920
Jeez, Laem!

346
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:02,480
- Get out!
- No, you get out!

347
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,080
Yeah...

348
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:12,520
Yes, that's right.
No one is fighting here.

349
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:14,000
We all love each other.

350
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:15,200
Yes, we do.

351
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:18,480
(Daily Training Schedule)

352
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,640
Let's warm up with a 1v1 match
and see who's really better.

353
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:24,920
