365
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,640
You jerk!

366
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,040
Noob. Trash.

367
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:53,840
You bastard!

368
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,000
Whoa, such a throw.

369
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,200
Sh*t, man.

370
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,880
If you're going to be
such a chicken,

371
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,560
