416
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,240
I guess this isn't enough.

417
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,200
What should I do?

418
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:02,960
Or maybe...

419
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:05,640
