420
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:15,160
Time to recharge, P'Three.

421
00:22:16,120 --> 00:22:18,040
I'll be your personal power bank.

422
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:20,440
Is this a fast-charging system?

423
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:22,480
I feel fully recharged now.

424
00:22:24,520 --> 00:22:27,520
♪If I'm the only one
who's loving with all my heart♪

425
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:30,800
♪So many times I've rehearsed the line♪

426
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:34,040
