427
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:35,600
You're not feeling stressed
anymore, right?

428
00:22:37,320 --> 00:22:38,760
Yes, for now.

429
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:40,320
But I'll probably be stressed
again tomorrow

430
00:22:40,520 --> 00:22:41,920
