435
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:59,800
but if you don't play into his hands,

436
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:03,880
I don't think there'll be any issues.

437
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:07,760
And things will eventually get better.

438
00:23:14,800 --> 00:23:15,960
Okay.

439
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:20,400
I'll try my best to stay calm for you.

440
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,040
Is that okay?

441
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:26,320
You're the best, P'Three.

442
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:34,400
Blame yourself for once
instead of blaming me!

443
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,840
Why should I blame myself?

444
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,000
Blame yourself!

445
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:37,840
You screwed up!

446
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:40,120
- Screwed up what, exactly?
- Hey, you *sshole.

447
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:42,800
You think you're so damn good, huh?

448
00:23:42,840 --> 00:23:44,920
- Yeah, I am that good!
- Then bring it!

449
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:46,520
- I'm right here!
- Whoa, hey!

450
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:47,960
Take it easy.

451
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:53,000
These two don't seem to click at all.

452
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:54,640
Yeah, dammit.

453
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:57,120
I even tried scolding them
and talking to them nicely...

454
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:01,600
This is not working. It's a disaster.

455
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:06,400
And P'Pech wants us
to film for YouTube as well.

456
00:24:06,840 --> 00:24:07,520
Yeah.

457
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:10,480
Now everyone's going to see them
fighting non-stop.

458
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:13,440
They're so full of themselves,
thinking they're the best.

459
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:16,200
It's just a massive ego clash.

460
00:24:16,320 --> 00:24:18,160
I honestly don't know what to do.

461
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,520
So it's an ego thing, huh?

462
00:24:24,040 --> 00:24:25,120
How about we try this?

463
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,280
Rolling!

464
00:24:26,320 --> 00:24:28,600
Three, two, one.

465
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:33,640
Hello, everyone.

466
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:38,160
Today, we are bringing you
a fun little challenge.

467
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,880
It's called...

468
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:42,720
'Role Swap:
Wow, Can't Believe We're Doing This!'

469
00:24:47,320 --> 00:24:49,880
Playing the same old way
is just too ordinary

470
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:53,560
since each of us is a "god"
in our own role.

471
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:55,440
I think it's getting a bit boring,

472
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:59,440
so we're all going to swap roles
for this match!

473
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,920
Huh? What?

474
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:03,280
Wait, what is this?

475
00:25:03,320 --> 00:25:05,840
Whoa, what a sudden surprise.

476
00:25:07,040 --> 00:25:08,240
Are you scared, Three?

477
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:11,160
It's just a game.
What's there to be afraid of?

478
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:13,120
Who said I was afraid of you, Ten?

479
00:25:13,280 --> 00:25:15,520
- Well, aren't you scared?
- I've been waiting for this, too.

480
00:25:15,520 --> 00:25:16,840
- Then let's do this.
- Bring it on.

481
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:18,960
- Let's see what you've got.
- Come on.

482
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,840
- Bring it on!
- Bring it.

483
00:25:20,920 --> 00:25:21,840
Come on, dammit.

484
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,320
If there are no objections,

485
00:25:23,520 --> 00:25:26,000
