489
00:25:35,120 --> 00:25:37,960
Now, let's start
the random hero selection.

490
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:39,800
Piece of cake.

491
00:25:40,080 --> 00:25:41,360
I'm fine with any role,

492
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:43,960
but it'd be great if I got Carry

493
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:46,560
