500
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:01,080
Oh, you want a piece of me?

501
00:26:01,120 --> 00:26:02,360
Come on, just try to be on my level.

502
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:04,320
Try to play Carry as well as I do.

503
00:26:04,360 --> 00:26:06,120
Real pros don't brag, guys.

504
00:26:06,800 --> 00:26:07,640
Hey!

505
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:09,480
They're all over me. Come support me!

506
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:11,520
Yeah, hold on. I'm on my way.

507
00:26:15,520 --> 00:26:16,680
Dammit.

508
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:18,480
You literally let me die on purpose!

509
00:26:18,840 --> 00:26:20,080
You're freaking cheating.

510
00:26:20,360 --> 00:26:21,400
Nothing I can do about that.

511
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:23,240
The rules have loopholes.

512
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:27,440
Just focus on playing better.

513
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:33,240
Go for it!

514
00:26:42,760 --> 00:26:45,440
See? How can you make it
if you don't stick together?

515
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:47,920
Losing like an idiot.

516
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:54,760
Hey, cut that last part out.

517
00:26:54,760 --> 00:26:55,600
Okay.

518
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:58,680
Hey, dive in! Where is everyone?

519
00:26:58,840 --> 00:27:00,200
