520
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,680
Is no one defending the base?

521
00:27:19,120 --> 00:27:20,960
(The Red Team's tower
has been destroyed)

522
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:28,400
Cut!

523
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:31,040
What the hell are you doing?

524
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,840
You here to cause trouble or something?

525
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:34,120
Are you here just to mess with us?

526
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:36,240
Do you even actually
want to be on my team?

527
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:37,840
I was only following the rules.

528
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:39,640
Besides, it's just for a video.

529
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:41,240
